1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Getting one percent better matters because it multiplies

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Not because the single improvement is significant

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,000
But because it compounds over time

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,000
The effects of your habits multiply as you repeat them

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:29,000
A simple daily habit that seems meaningless

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:35,000
can transform your life years from now

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,000
This is called the Plateau of Latent Potential